WEBVTT

00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:00.179
Basic archaeological protocol
is to find the edge of a settlement

00:03:00.203 --> 00:03:02.074
so you know what you're dealing with,

00:03:02.098 --> 00:03:05.216
and my graduate students
convinced me to do just that.

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:10.092
So I grabbed a couple of CLIF Bars,
some water, a walkie,

00:03:10.116 --> 00:03:12.176
and I set out alone on foot,

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.732
expecting to encounter "the edge"
in just a few minutes.

00:03:16.151 --> 00:03:17.905
A few minutes passed.

00:03:17.929 --> 00:03:19.503
And then an hour.

00:03:19.527 --> 00:03:22.005
Finally, I reached
the other side of the malpais.

00:03:22.483 --> 00:03:26.571
Oh, there were ancient
building foundations all the way across.

00:03:27.139 --> 00:03:28.812
It's a city?

00:03:28.836 --> 00:03:30.209
Oh, shit.